flowchart LR
  Login[Windows sign-in] --> Guardian[RosettAI Guardian<br/>per-user process]
  Guardian --> Discover[Discover supported installed harnesses]
  Discover --> Map[Resolve supported global bootstrap location]
  Map --> Check{RosettAI marker<br/>and hash valid?}
  Check -->|Yes| Monitor[Record healthy state]
  Check -->|No, policy allows| Repair[Install or repair owned bootstrap]
  Check -->|No, consent required| Alert[Report actionable drift]
  Repair --> Monitor
  Monitor --> Tick[Periodic bounded check]
  Tick --> Discover

  Agent[Agent opens repository] --> Bootstrap[Harness global bootstrap]
  Bootstrap --> Canonical{RosettAI manifest found?}
  Canonical -->|No| Continue[Normal behavior]
  Canonical -->|Yes| Status[Run rai status]
  Status --> Active{Compatible projection active?}
  Active -->|Yes| Continue
  Active -->|No| Warning[Visible RosettAI warning]

  subgraph LocalState [Local and ignored]
    Guardian
    Monitor
    Alert
  end
